//   / / / / / / / / / / / /
//  / / / /_/ / /_/ / /_/ /
// /_/  \____/_____/\____/
//
// - Lossy UDP socket for testing purposes: send and receive ops are wrappers
// that stochastically drop or reorder packets.
// - Sending FIN on drop
// - Handle packet loss
// - Path MTU discovery (RFC4821)

